---
title: State Machine — ServiceAgreement (MF-01)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT : HR prepares draft
  DRAFT --> SENT_TO_CLIENT : HR sends PDF to Client
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> CHANGE_REQUESTED : Client requests changes
  CHANGE_REQUESTED --> VOID : HR issues new version (v+1)
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> ACCEPTED : Client accepts terms
  ACCEPTED --> SIGNED : Signed file uploaded & HR approves
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> SIGNED : Direct signed PDF upload & HR approves
  SENT_TO_CLIENT --> VOID : Superseded or job rejected
  VOID --> [*]
  SIGNED --> [*]
